<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">ERP Project & Job Costing Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Professional project governance that connects delivery milestones to financial reality, providing 
            granular job costing for service and project-based enterprises.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Precision Job Costing</h2>
        <p>
            Understand the true profitability of your projects with integrated job costing. The system 
            captures every direct cost—material requisitions from the warehouse, direct labor hours 
            from timesheets, and external subcontractor invoices—linking them directly to a 
            specific project and phase. This granular tracking allows for precise calculation 
            of project margins and identifies cost overruns before they impact 
            overall organizational profitability.
        </p>
        <p>
            Work-In-Progress (WIP) valuation feeds the general ledger automatically according 
            to IAS 11, ensuring that your financial statements accurately reflect the 
            value created during project delivery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Milestone and Resource Governance</h2>
        <p>
            Structure your projects into logical phases and milestones with integrated task 
            assignment and Gantt chart visualizations. Monitor resource utilization rates 
            across your technical and professional teams, identifying capacity bottlenecks 
            before they impact delivery timelines. Standardized project templates ensure 
            methodological consistency across the organization, institutionalizing 
            delivery best practices.
        </p>
        <p>
            Mobile-first timesheet and expense capture allow your field teams to record progress 
            and expenditure as it happens, shortening the feedback loop between project 
            activity and financial reporting.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Integrated Client Billing</h2>
        <p>
            Seamlessly transition from project activity to client invoicing. Whether your contracts 
            are time-and-material or fixed-fee milestones, the system automatically pulls 
            approved hours and material costs into the billing engine. This integration 
            eliminates manual billing errors and significantly reduces the time 
            required to generate complex project invoices.
        </p>
        <p>
            Detailed project Profit & Loss (P&L) reporting provides management with visibility into 
            performance by client, project type, and location, supporting strategic 
            decisions on service lines and commercial priorities.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

